<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[County-domain (SINGLE) inventory for Washtenaw with TIME AGGREGATION by year,
as scale-county-timeagg-year (<aggregateBy key="Year"/>, <outputtimestep
value="Year"/>; January, April, July and October 2020, both day types, all 24
hours; road types 1 and 4), for the gasoline passenger car (21) and the
diesel combination long-haul truck (62). It selects what scale-county-timeagg-year does not
check at Year, running and start exhaust: the hydrocarbon species (CH4, NMHC,
NMOG, TOG, VOC, NonHAPTOG at running), the gaseous air toxics (ATRatio,
ATRatioNonGas, minorHAPRatio, pahGasRatio; PreAggYEAR.sql averages ATRatio and
ATBaseEmissions by MonthGroupWeighting before FuelEffectsGenerator runs), NO,
NO2, HONO, N2O, NH3, SO2, energy, CO2 and CO2 equivalent -- at start exhaust
without N2O, CO2 equivalent and the six ATRatio toxics (benzene, ethanol,
1,3-butadiene, formaldehyde, acetaldehyde, acrolein), whose start-exhaust
paths moves.esm does not compute at any aggregation. No PM (see
scale-county-timeagg-year-pm), no evaporative or refueling process. County
database county-inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg/setup-timeagg.sql.]]></description>
